WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.450
How long to cook a 2 kilogram chicken?

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:07.870
One rule says 40 minutes per kilogram, + 20.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:13.740
40 × 2 is 80, + 20 is 100 minutes.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.710
Plug in the number, follow the recipe.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:21.013
Same rule, any chicken.
